  "notes": "12-step orange scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: orangeA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/orange.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/orange-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --orange-1: #fefcfb;\n  --orange-2: #fff7ed;\n  --orange-3: #ffefd6;\n  --orange-4: #ffdfb5;\n  --orange-5: #ffd19a;\n  --orange-6: #ffc182;\n  --orange-7: #f5ae73;\n  --orange-8: #ec9455;\n  --orange-9: #f76b15;\n  --orange-10: #ef5f00;\n  --orange-11: #cc4e00;\n  --orange-12: #582d1d;\n}\n.dark {\n  --orange-1: #17120e;\n  --orange-2: #1e160f;\n  --orange-3: #331e0b;\n  --orange-4: #462100;\n  --orange-5: #562800;\n  --orange-6: #66350c;\n  --orange-7: #7e451d;\n  --orange-8: #a35829;\n  --orange-9: #f76b15;\n  --orange-10: #ff801f;\n  --orange-11: #ffa057;\n  --orange-12: #ffe0c2;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix orange</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fefcfb\" title=\"--orange-1: #fefcfb\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#fff7ed\" title=\"--orange-2: #fff7ed\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffefd6\" title=\"--orange-3: #ffefd6\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffdfb5\" title=\"--orange-4: #ffdfb5\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffd19a\" title=\"--orange-5: #ffd19a\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffc182\" title=\"--orange-6: #ffc182\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#f5ae73\" title=\"--orange-7: #f5ae73\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#ec9455\" title=\"--orange-8: #ec9455\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#f76b15\" title=\"--orange-9: #f76b15\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#ef5f00\" title=\"--orange-10: #ef5f00\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#cc4e00\" title=\"--orange-11: #cc4e00\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#582d1d\" title=\"--orange-12: #582d1d\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#17120e\" title=\"--orange-1: #17120e\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#1e160f\" title=\"--orange-2: #1e160f\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#331e0b\" title=\"--orange-3: #331e0b\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#462100\" title=\"--orange-4: #462100\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#562800\" title=\"--orange-5: #562800\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#66350c\" title=\"--orange-6: #66350c\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#7e451d\" title=\"--orange-7: #7e451d\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#a35829\" title=\"--orange-8: #a35829\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#f76b15\" title=\"--orange-9: #f76b15\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#ff801f\" title=\"--orange-10: #ff801f\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffa057\" title=\"--orange-11: #ffa057\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffe0c2\" title=\"--orange-12: #ffe0c2\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
